1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.590
Song two: Butterflies and Love. Aya's song, the Infinite Garden anthem.

2
00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:14.190
Key of G. The whole song is one loop: E minor, C, D, G. Four chords, round and round.

3
00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:23.051
This one takes the island strum: one and two and three and four and. Down, down up, up down up. Keep it steady.

4
00:00:23.501 --> 00:00:34.394
E minor on We should only wage war, C on war, D on love, then G. The infinite garden sits on G and E minor; isn't just a place for fun on C and D.

5
00:00:34.844 --> 00:00:47.487
All we need to wage in a war: E minor, C. Is butterflies and love: D, G. Because Ethereum is a positive sum: C, D, G. Built by and for everyone.

6
00:00:47.937 --> 00:00:56.505
The placements on the sheet were set by ear, so if I play it differently in the room, follow me. All we need to wage in a war is butterflies and love.

7
00:00:56.955 --> 00:01:02.780
This voice was made by the AI ʻohana in Shaka's voice — he blessed the lesson, the words are ours.
